### R1-SAFE-001: missing failure-mode tests for --dispatch-note + --status-md path containment

**Bug:** fix-round-3 added os.path.realpath + repo-root containment for --dispatch-note and --status-md but no test exercises these guards in failure mode (case 19 covers only --branch-protection-log out-of-repo). Code regression removing either check would go undetected.

**Fix:** in tests/check_invocation_log/test_check_invocation_log_entry.sh add two test cases mirroring case 19:
1. `--dispatch-note <out-of-repo-path>` (mktemp outside TMPDIR case-repo) → exit 2 + 'ERROR: --dispatch-note must resolve inside repository root' (or equivalent diagnostic).
2. `--status-md <out-of-repo-path>` → exit 2 + 'ERROR: --status-md must resolve inside repository root' (or equivalent).

